  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Compatible with Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) and Choc V2 (PG1353) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.3=13.95mm square (Kailh Choc V2), User.4=13.80mm square (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: 2.00u (courtyard 38.05x19.00mm). Kailh Choc V2 stabilizer (CPG1353G24D01): PCB cutout slots (Edge.Cuts). Plate required; plate cutout per Keebio plate generator. For Choc V2 / Gateron KS-33 only (not Choc V1).")
